l activity tracking and achievement system\n**Deliverables**:\n- Activity aggregation mechanism\n- Three initial achievement types:\n  1. Collective Task Completion\n  2. Efficiency Badge\n  3. Collaboration Star\n- Persistence and query interface for achievements\n- Comprehensive unit tests\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Track family-level metrics\n- Implement 3 defined achievement types\n- Tracking operation overhead < 5ms\n- Queryable achievement interface\n- 90%+ test coverage for tracking logic\n\n### Milestone 3: API and Frontend Integration\n**Objective**: Seamlessly integrate family system into existing infrastructure\n**Deliverables**:\n- REST API endpoints for family information\n- Updated React components to display family relationships\n- Integration tests\n- Performance and compatibility validation\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Expose family data through REST endpoints\n- Update UI to show family names and achievements\n- Maintain existing performance standards\n- Backwards compatibility preserved\n- 90%+ test coverage for integration components\n\n## Cross-Cutting Requirements\n- Maintain < 5ms performance overhead\n- 90%+ test coverage across all components\n- No breaking changes to existing systems\n- Graceful handling of legacy agent data'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Hnv6cZgmw9sVfKFGQSAwJj', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224318.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224318.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01JJc1V3DrmekaV8chiycJw7', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data