{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:47:34", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-a1705a71-688c-4670-92ae-201b35e27c2d', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "problem_description": "Continue implementation of GitHub Sync Bot Milestone 1: Core Infrastructure & Remote Operations. Need to implement the 15 backend tasks, 16 test tasks, and 21 frontend tasks as defined in the task breakdown files. Focus on remote repository connection management, basic fetch/pull operations, configuration system integration, and core error handling framework.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots",\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/requirements.md"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01GjvxXDhwAmk8AvsDRhFBr5', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'GitHub Sync Bot Milestone 1', 'description': 'Implement core infrastructure and remote operations for GitHub Sync Bot, including backend, frontend, and test tasks focusing on repository connection management, fetch/pull operations, configuration system, and error handling.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01GjvxXDhwAmk8AvsDRhFBr5', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "fc62241a", "message": "Created project: GitHub Sync Bot Milestone 1", "summary": {"project_id": "fc62241a", "project_name": "GitHub Sync Bot Milestone 1", "description": "Implement core infrastructure and remote operations for GitHub Sync Bot, including backend, frontend, and test tasks focusing on repository connection management, fetch/pull operations, configuration system, and error handling.", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T22:47:25.541904", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T22:47:25.541904", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T22:47:25.541904", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'GitHub Sync Bot Milestone 1\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01H9NbefnFRnGLUSvP3EceSV', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01H9NbefnFRnGLUSvP3EceSV', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# GitHub Sync Bot Requirements\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n- **Milestone**: 2 of 6 in GitHub Bots Suite\\n- **Purpose**: Implement advanced git synchronization capabilities\\n\\n## Core Capabilities\\n1. Remote Synchronization\\n   - Fetch and pull operations from remote repositories\\n   - Support for multiple remote repositories\\n   \\n2. Branch Management\\n   - Rebase operations with robust conflict handling\\n   - Safe stash management (save, restore, list)\\n   \\n3. Error Handling\\n   - Detailed conflict detection\\n   - Clear error reporting\\n   - Preservation of uncommitted changes\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- \\u2713 Successfully rebase branch with upstream changes\\n- \\u2713 Safely stash uncommitted changes before sync\\n- \\u2713 Detect and report conflicts clearly\\n- \\u2713 Restore stashed changes after successful sync\\n- \\u2713 Complete operations within 30 seconds for typical repositories\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- Use existing base classes and configuration system\\n- Implement using Test-Driven Development (TDD)\\n- Comprehensive error handling\\n- Logging of all synchronization events\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Full repository migration\\n- Complex merge conflict resolution\\n- Support for non-git version control systems\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Base git configuration and authentication are already set up\\n- Typical repository size is under 1GB\\n- Standard git workflow (single branch, linear history)"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': 'You are a  agent.\n\n## Purpose\n\n\n## Instructions\n\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nYou must respond with JSON matching this exact format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## When to Request Clarification\nRequest clarification when:\n\n\n## Termination Conditions\nYou are done when:\n\n\nCRITICAL: Your response must be valid JSON matching the Output Format exactly.\n\n## Your Performance History\n- Success rate: 100.0%\n- Average iterations per task: 5.6\n\n**Tips for this run:**\n- Great work! Maintain your high performance standards.\n', 'tools': [{'name': 'write_file', 'description': 'Write content to a file, creating parent directories if needed. Automatically backs up existing files.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'file_path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Path to the file to write'}, 'content': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Content to write to the file'}}, 'required': ['file_path', 'content']}}, {'name': 'read_file', 'description': 'Read content from a file', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'file_path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Path to the file to read'}}, 'required': ['file_path']}}, {'name': 'run_command', 'description': 'Execute a shell command and return the output', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'command': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'The shell command to execute'}, 'working_directory': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Optional working directory for command execution'}}, 'required': ['command']}}, {'name': 'git_commit', 'description': 'Commit changes to the git repository with a descriptive message', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'message': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Commit message describing the changes'}, 'files': {'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string'}, 'description': 'Optional list of specific files to commit. If not provided, commits all modified files.'}}, 'required': ['message']}}, {'name': 'git_branch', 'description': 'Create, switch, list, or delete git branches for coordinated development', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'action': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['create', 'switch', 'list', 'delete', 'current'], 'description': 'Action to perform: create new branch, switch to existing, list all, delete, or get current'}, 'branch_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Name of the branch (for create, switch, delete)'}, 'from_branch': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Base branch to create from (for create, defaults to current branch)'}, 'force': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'Force the operation (for delete unmerged branches)', 'default': False}}, 'required': ['action']}}, {'name': 'git_merge', 'description': 'Merge branches or create pull requests for code review', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'action': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['merge', 'preview', 'abort'], 'description': 'Action: merge branches, preview changes, or abort an in-progress merge'}, 'source_branch': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Branch to merge from'}, 'target_branch': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Branch to merge into (defaults to current branch)'}, 'strategy': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['merge', 'squash', 'rebase'], 'description': 'Merge strategy (default: merge)', 'default': 'merge'}, 'message': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Custom merge commit message (optional)'}, 'no_ff': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'Create merge commit even if fast-forward is possible', 'default': True}}, 'required': ['action']}}, {'name': 'git_status', 'description': 'Get comprehensive git repository status including branches, changes, and history', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'include_history': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'Include recent commit history', 'default': False}, 'history_count': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of commits to include in history', 'default': 10}}, 'required': []}}, {'name': 'project_tracking', 'description': 'Manage project state, tasks, and notes for the current project', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'action': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['create_project', 'add_task', 'update_task', 'add_note', 'get_summary', 'get_next_tasks'], 'description': 'Action to perform'}, 'project_id': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Project ID (not needed for create_project)'}, 'project_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Project name (for create_project)'}, 'description': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Description (for create_project or add_task)'}, 'task_id': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Task ID (for update_task)'}, 'status': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['todo', 'in_progress', 'completed', 'blocked', 'cancelled'], 'description': 'Task status (for update_task)'}, 'note': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Note text (for add_note or update_task)'}, 'assigned_to': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Agent type (for add_task)'}, 'category': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['general', 'decision', 'milestone', 'issue'], 'description': 'Note category (for add_note)'}}, 'required': ['action']}}, {'name': 'spawn_agent', 'description': 'Spawn and execute a specialist agent to perform a specific task', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'agent_type': {'type': 'string', 'description': "The type of agent to spawn (e.g., 'code_writer', 'code_tester')"}, 'in